\maketitle
\chapter{Overview}
This report collects our field experience with vibration-based screening of conveyor bearings across two depot sites over fourteen months. It is written for the maintenance teams who will operate the screening workflow day to day: Chapter 2 describes the field background and the measurement practices already in use, Chapter 3 defines the screening score we adopted, and Chapter 4 derives the calibration applied to handheld meter readings before they enter the worksheet.
